/// Build the user's strategy over `HostBroker` and hand the host an opaque handle. `params_ptr`/
/// `params_len` are a borrowed `(ptr, len)` valid only for the duration of this call — the same
/// contract `abi`'s module doc states for every string that crosses this boundary — so the bytes
